# Ground and air stations: the command net, the AWACS net (SKYWATCH) and the tower net.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- command

@command.event status
[*] Theater update. <title>. The event desk has the details.
[*] All flights, be advised: <title>. Details at the event desk.
[*] Command to all stations. <title>. Read the event desk.
[*] <title>. That is now in effect. Check the event desk.
[*] Priority traffic: <title>. Acknowledge and stand by.
[*] Theater has logged a development. <title>. Carry on.

@command.operation status
[*] Operation <name>. Phase is now <phase>.
[*] All flights, <name> is <phase>. Adjust accordingly.
[*] Command advises: <name>, phase <phase>. Acknowledge.
[*] <name> status change. Phase <phase>. Stay sharp.
[*] Operation <name> now reads <phase>. Orders follow if needed.
[*] <name>, phase <phase>. Keep your flights tight.
[* night] <name> is <phase>. Expect a long night.

@command.insertion status
[*] Insertion element is down. Ground control has them.
[*] Friendly troops are on the ground. Keep the air clear.
[*] Landing zone confirmed. The assault element is on the ground.
[*] Air assault touched down. Cover them if you can.
[*] Ground element reports boots down. Stay on station.
[*] Insertion complete. They are on their own until relieved.

@command.basetaken tactical
[*] <base> is ours. Secure the perimeter.
[*] Command confirms <base> captured. Good work out there.
[*] <base> has fallen to our side. Hold what we took.
[*] We have <base>. Engineers are moving up.
[*] <base> is in friendly hands. Expect a counterattack.
[*] Capture of <base> confirmed. Do not get comfortable.

@command.baselost tactical
[*] We have lost <base>. Reform and fall back.
[*] <base> is gone. Command is reassessing.
[*] Enemy forces hold <base>. Plan around it.
[*] Be advised, <base> has been taken. Expect pressure on the next line.
[*] <base> is lost. Redirect your sorties and stay alive.
[*] Command confirms the loss of <base>. We take it back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- AWACS

@awacs.checkin status
[*] Skywatch has you on radar. Picture is clean. Good hunting.
[*] Radar contact. You are on my scope. Report any change.
[*] Skywatch on station. I have you, and the picture is quiet.
[*] You are radar contact, climbing out. I will call it if it moves.
[*] Welcome to the party. Skywatch has your six.
[*] Contact established. Nothing hostile in range, for now.
[*] Skywatch is watching. Fly safe and bring everyone home.
[*] I have you on the scope. Picture is yours when you need it.
[* night] Radar contact. It is a dark one, so trust your instruments.
[* rain] Skywatch has you through the weather. Expect clutter on the scope.

@awacs.bandit tactical
[*] Bandit, <bra>.
[*] Bandit, <bra>. Type is <type>.
[*] New hostile, <bra>. Looks like a <type>.
[*] Bandit bearing <bra>. Your call.
[*] Contact, <bra>, hostile <type>.
[*] Hostile aircraft, <bra>. Confirm visual.
[*] Fresh bandit, <bra>. A <type>, and it knows you are here.
[*] Bandit, <bra>. Do not lose sight of him.
[* night] Bandit, <bra>. He is dark, watch for his flare.

@awacs.bogeydope tactical
[*] Nearest threat, <bra>.
[*] Bogey dope. Bandit <bra>, a <type>.
[*] Closest hostile is <bra>. Type <type>.
[*] Picture: one bandit, <bra>.
[*] Nearest bandit, <bra>. Heads up.
[*] You have a <type> at <bra>. He is the nearest.
[*] Threat bearing <bra>. Nothing closer.
[*] Bogey dope, <bra>. It is a <type>, so keep your speed.

@awacs.clean tactical
[*] Picture clean.
[*] Nothing out there. Picture is clean.
[*] Skywatch sees no hostiles. All quiet.
[*] Clean scope from here. Stay alert.
[*] No bandits on my picture. Enjoy it.
[*] I have nothing hostile in range.
[*] Sky is empty for now. It will not last.
[*] Clean. Check your own six anyway.
[* night] Picture clean. Quiet night, so far.

@awacs.missile emergency
[*] Missile launch, your <clock>. Break!
[*] Missile, <clock>! Defend now!
[*] Launch detected, <clock>. Break and flare!
[*] Missile inbound, <clock>! Go defensive!
[*] Shot at your <clock>! Break!
[*] Missile at <clock>, closing. Notch it!

@awacs.missileclear tactical
[*] Missile is defeated. You are clear.
[*] Clear. Nothing guiding on you now.
[*] That one is gone. Well flown.
[*] Skywatch shows no missiles. Take a breath.
[*] You beat it. Reset and get your picture back.
[*] Missile lost lock. Stay on your toes.
[*] No more tracks on you. Nice break.
[*] Threat cleared. Come back to heading.

@awacs.splash tactical
[*] Splash one <target>. Good kill.
[*] Splash, <target>. Confirmed on my scope.
[*] Kill confirmed. That <target> is down.
[*] Splash. Target destroyed.
[*] Good shooting. <target> is gone from my picture.
[*] Scratch one. Skywatch confirms.
[*] That is a kill. Nicely done.
[*] <target> is out of the fight. Moving on.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- tower

@tower.taxi status
[*] You are cleared to taxi, <runway>. Hold short of the line.
[*] Cleared to taxi, <runway>. Report holding short.
[*] Taxi to the hold point, <runway>. Wind is light.
[*] Cleared to taxi, <runway>. Mind the lead-in line.
[*] You may taxi, <runway>. Nothing in your way.
[*] Taxi, <runway>, via the main taxiway. Call at the hold.
[*] Cleared to taxi, <runway>. Fuel trucks are clear.
[* night] Cleared to taxi, <runway>. Follow the blue lights.
[* rain] Cleared to taxi, <runway>. Taxiways are wet, go easy.

@tower.landing status
[*] Cleared to land, <runway>.
[*] <runway>, cleared to land. Wind is calm.
[*] You are cleared to land, <runway>. Welcome back.
[*] Cleared to land, <runway>. Runway is clear.
[*] Cleared to land, <runway>. Call down.
[*] You are number one, cleared to land, <runway>.
[*] Land, <runway>. We have the field ready for you.
[* night] Cleared to land, <runway>. The lights are up and steady.
[* rain] Cleared to land, <runway>. Runway is wet, expect poor braking.

@tower.goaround status
[*] Go around.
[*] Go around, I say again, go around. Climb and maintain.
[*] Tower sees you are off the approach. Go around.
[*] Go around and set up again. No rush.
[*] Missed approach. Fly the pattern again.
[*] Go around, the field is yours when you are ready.
[*] Break off. Go around and call downwind.
[* rain] Go around. Visibility is down, give it another try.

@tower.airborne status
[*] Airborne. Contact departure.
[*] You are off the ground. Good luck out there.
[*] Wheels up, I have you. Tower is off the net.
[*] Airborne, clear of the field. Have a good one.
[*] Tower sees you airborne. Cleared on course.
[*] Off the deck. Fly safe.
[*] Airborne. We will keep the light on for you.
[* night] Airborne. The runway lights fade behind you.

@tower.welcome status
[*] Welcome home.
[*] Welcome back. Exit when able and taxi to parking.
[*] You are down. Good to see you in one piece.
[*] Down and safe. Taxi to parking, the crew is waiting.
[*] Welcome home. Coffee is on, you earned it.
[*] Nice landing. Taxi clear of the runway.
[*] You made it back. Tower is glad to see you.
[* night] Welcome home. Follow the lights in, we have the porch lit.
[* rain] Welcome back. Wet one today, wasn't it? Taxi to parking.

@tower.wingrolling status
[*] <who> is rolling.
[*] Tower sees <who> on the takeoff roll.
[*] <who> is rolling. Runway is clear ahead.
[*] <who> has started the roll. Good luck.
[*] <who> rolling now. Watch for them off the end.
[*] Takeoff roll, <who>. Stand by to join.
[*] <who> is on the run. Look for them climbing.

@tower.wingdown ambient
[*] <who> is down.
[*] <who> has landed and is clear of the runway.
[*] Welcome back, <who>.
[*] <who> is on the ground. Another one home.
[*] <who> down safely. Taxiing to parking.
[*] <who> landed. That is one more accounted for.
[*] Tower has <who> on the ground.

@tower.alarm emergency
[*] Base under attack! Get airborne or take cover!
[*] Alarm, alarm! Hostiles over the field! Scramble!
[*] Tower to all aircraft: field is under attack. Launch now!
[*] Incoming! Clear the runway and take cover!
[*] We are hit! Scramble what you can!
